{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "83c4faed40a47552438cc1dcfcb0e67f5dc885d0bf9fc298a3bd2fa940cb4f8d", "ja": "君だけのアンマッチ", "zh": "专属于你的不协调", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "522532c0a8a1d26fe0f9182bfdf9dd5685d329b007372087493dd9f1d05aad41", "ja": "キービジュアルの撮影、ミラス・ミラン組。\n歩はハイプライスなアイテムを身に着けての\nダンスに恐怖するも、きっちりとやり遂げ、\nまつりと共に担当者に絶賛される。可憐だけ\nリテイクが多く、気にする様子を見せる。", "zh": "关键视觉拍摄由ミラス・ミラン组负责。\n步穿着高价单品跳舞，虽然感到害怕，还是一丝不苟地完成了拍摄，并和茉莉一起获得了负责人的盛赞。只有可怜的重拍次数很多，似乎对此感到在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91648500069f4a0140eeb0af207c30debde60f00d3a6fdd3170ce13070fe6c14", "ja": "（ブランドアイテムを使っての撮影2日目……\n今日は可憐たちと、ミラス・ミランだ）", "zh": "（使用品牌单品进行拍摄的第2天……今天轮到可怜她们和米拉斯·米兰了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ffdc45f5080a48adb48d0731154cb96fd4fb48b452a6db464f8682f2b99c2bd", "ja": "た、助けて{$P$}！\nムリだよ、こんなの……アタシ、踊れないよーっ！", "zh": "救、救救我{$P$}！\n这种事我做不到……我、我跳不了啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fe83941d61c3cebe6e655e9ec5bcdf4271acb054f35853aad25d1d314d591ece", "ja": "頑張れ、歩！　頑張れ！", "zh": "加油，步！加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f0881e37addfd5614f2453b2fedd15d8faea96704eea0db262c00428e6aa61b", "ja": "い、いや、頑張りは関係ないって！　ていうか、\n今アタシがつけてるアクセ、よ、400万って……！", "zh": "不、不是，这跟加不加油没关系啦！话说回来，\n我现在戴着的这个饰品，居、居然要400万……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "06351b2c3c5bf52a4801a6429c959d3f77d4ce962bc074539e41a233b03146a8", "ja": "激しいダンスして、どっか飛んでっちゃったら\nどうすんの！？　こ、怖いよーっ！", "zh": "跳那么激烈的舞，要是飞到什么地方去了怎么办！？好、好可怕啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "21ba97ba36b2dddd6a3c35817ecb93dc75abeb46cbfe5b4bf8982cff48ffb1eb", "ja": "……。\nできる、できるさ！　歩なら！　きっと！", "zh": "……。\n能做到的，一定能做到的！只要是步的话！肯定没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ea385c486d47b9a1f09333e44949b0367d12e2cedfe84d356305675297471c42", "ja": "今、間があったよね！？　っていうか、\nなんにも具体的なこと言ってないよね！？　うぅっ！", "zh": "刚才，你是不是停顿了一下！？话说回来，你根本什么具体的事都没说吧！？呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2f2189412745ec4b89b39509cb2bede42439e932b99748a3852af01ec0a1f47b", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だって！　いざとなったら\n事務所で弁償するから、気にしなくていい！", "zh": "没、没事的！真到了那时候，就由事务所赔偿，所以不用在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c5fcd938fb5b8b25480c4f83a513c8fc2a55a773f85b20df70d9c0e4591a112e", "ja": "それより、躍動感のあるダンスをお願いしたいって\n話だからな。全力でやってくれ、歩！", "zh": "比起那个，他们说想要充满活力的舞蹈。拿出全力来吧，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9cc878f8f0052eb1141d6fa9296003233e4e6b67874ab8eb5075c990e5394254", "ja": "ほ、本当に？　……わかった！　信じるよ、\n{$P$}！　じゃあ……レッツダンス！", "zh": "真、真的？……明白了！我相信你，{$P$}！那么……一起跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "469cdf15a3dfef5880a1062b984e7c351efa9ae5e6e899813f40e9f6105ed7be", "ja": "（幾らまでいけるかな……経費で……）", "zh": "不知道能用经费报销到多少呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "a0a5a7c5360b3aef573cd4f0c65b3e3686dd6523d4efbac918a5281ad0155eec", "ja": "歩さん、お疲れさまでした……。\nとっても、カッコよかったです……！", "zh": "步小姐，辛苦了……。\n真的，帅极了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0e4c96a5ba2b4139f2ecbb084692f6500f8251680d1d51e91974d514c45dc9d6", "ja": "ありがとう、可憐……うぅ、でも、怖かったよ～！", "zh": "谢谢你，可怜……呜呜，不过，真的好可怕啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9623840b8e07e1165348f3255f5f78c6667d1683b82fd43de4ff0721d97f39e", "ja": "歩ちゃん、よしよしなのです。\nできれば、姫が代わってあげたかったのですが……", "zh": "阿步，乖乖哦。  \n要是可以的话，姬本来想替你去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "a5d6ccf69d22df9fae49f4159ba15ccac2fc7e24381be362092661d1ac3530ed", "ja": "あんなにわんだほー！なダンスは、\n姫には無理なのです。さすがなのですよ。", "zh": "那么精彩的舞蹈，姬是跳不出来的。真不愧是你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1015_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "579a2be3aa8ef1842cad39a2b87d33a30bc83c0817f79376a562fe96f0df791f", "ja": "舞浜様～！　やはり、貴女様のダンスは最高です！\nわたくしの目に間違いはなかった……！", "zh": "舞滨大人～！果然，您的舞蹈是最棒的！我的眼光果然没错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "670ed23ea8c1821a8e9b6d442257af7d72aba2af57a6a29215c6b14847b60b6b", "ja": "そ、そう？　まあ、みんながそう言ってくれるなら、\nアタシの役目は果たせたってことかな……えへへ。", "zh": "是、是吗？不过，既然大家都这么说，那就说明我已经完成任务了吧……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e334cd7de273840e02fa2bcbacc9126c933bd236dfa5f3e591fe11d316a5c137", "ja": "けどさ、まつりも凄いじゃん！\nここまで全部、一発オッケーしてるよね？", "zh": "不过，茉莉也很厉害嘛！\n到现在为止，全部都是一次通过的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "35306a6971cd24a2a1830578c52a5d37d32a6774f792b87098660de6ed77a04d", "ja": "はいなのです！　姫は今、\nテンションが上がりっぱなしなのです！", "zh": "是的！公主现在一直都处于兴奋状态哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "cc6fe197959d62e10de376be4f27bd52ad68e8879ddbdc5d50d9774b8d6eeeec", "ja": "ミラス・ミランのデザインは、姫もずっと\n憧れていたのです……メロメロまつりなのです～。", "zh": "米拉斯·米兰的设计，本公主一直都很憧憬……祭已经被迷得神魂颠倒啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "87db813b5b5d72193a704302b7eedb9b722de5513cd48e2d9197a9f490f023d3", "ja": "キラキラはいほー！なお仕事に、姫の魔法も\nみらくる・ぱわほー！になっているのですよ♪", "zh": "在闪闪发光、干劲十足的工作中，公主的魔法也变得奇迹般强大了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1021_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "1d2f2fad1ae876643e629ffd021c731e3adc68199ccaf6ebef3ca616fe7a8536", "ja": "それは光栄ですね～。徳川様にも、大変よいお仕事を\nしていただいて、助かっております。", "zh": "那真是荣幸呢～。德川大人也一直出色地完成工作，帮了我们大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a5dfd15097b1a80355a5638439b0a05bf8f5f7f0052ea342ab5b530b4e8c3d05", "ja": "つまり、やる気に満ちているってことだな。\nなによりだ。", "zh": "也就是说，你干劲十足嘛。\n这再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "78ca89b511648d0f35ad4297f51b87eaa4aa898f705afbf42e91e86568ad74ea", "ja": "やっぱりハイブランドは、プリンセスになるための\n必須アイテム、ってところか……。", "zh": "果然，高端品牌是成为公主的必备单品吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "43d806258b0726ee451bac454b02b59ff42eb9bdc5e92b7c7f51906d6237962c", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん。\nそれはちょっとだけ、違うのですよ？", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生。那可有一点点不对哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "42362b4f0858d8c4608e4422df75072e75a05a5f248fda5102bb9b41abecc8bf", "ja": "たとえブランド品がなかったとしても、\n女の子はみんな、プリンセスなのです♪", "zh": "即使没有名牌商品，女孩子也都是公主哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "b2b5968cffd70eb8fd3fc75329905604ff864a8ba4c47e3464679f34d5f4be45", "ja": "でも、もしも身につけることがあれば……\n誰よりも綺麗に、輝いて見せるのです♪", "zh": "不过，要是有机会戴上的话……\n我会让自己比任何人都更加美丽，闪闪发光哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "978a6ccde9a21b3448f711f784a50ce9163e1f14b1a5193bd885a259de5aa32e", "ja": "誰よりも綺麗に、か……やっぱ、まつりってすごいよ！\nアタシなんて、振り回されっぱなしだったし……。", "zh": "比谁都漂亮吗……果然茉莉很厉害啊！\n我可是一直都被她牵着鼻子走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "60a113aa22a10699385ae9ceb0f949e86128ec1f268b336be4edb57d5aff24f6", "ja": "すごいなぁ……歩さんも、まつりさんも。\n……はぁ。", "zh": "真厉害啊……步小姐和茉莉小姐。\n……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ce5c426dd95143f2f4277844bab0f10d81caa3268ef66cd42ac3f6973cfa2810", "ja": "可憐？", "zh": "可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "ba1059c7aacda901e68dd6be795fb8839ad0d33546308efdc04a9a7dac51b305", "ja": "あ……ええと……私だけ、リテイク続きで……\nあ、足を引っ張っちゃってるから……情けなくて。", "zh": "啊……那个……只有我一直在重拍……\n因为……我拖了大家的后腿……觉得自己真没用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_04_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "4beeb0e0b9d92a543ed2f3376ffab07cb455045e99aeff5d5076a5cf1bbcecf9", "ja": "やっぱり、私がセンターなんて……。", "zh": "果然，让我当C位什么的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
